              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Non-normal distributions or extreme outliers can distort Pearson correlation, yet the data are unchecked.",
              "actionableFix": "Provide summary statistics (min, max, mean, SD, skewness) and visualizations (histograms, boxplots) before correlation.",
              "reentryPoint": "execution",
